cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ALchemist in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ALchemist: Active Learning Toolkit for Chemical and Materials Research"
abstract: >-
  Active learning and Bayesian optimization for experimental research: define the
  variables, run a first design, record the results, and let a Gaussian process
  choose the next experiment. A web app, a desktop app, a Python library and a
  REST API.
